<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Support — Nevarro Technologies</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{--canvas:#f7f7f4;--surface:#f2f1ed;--border:#dedcd6;--text:#26251e;--muted:#7a7974;--faint:#a1a19f;--ember:#f54e00;
    --sans:'Inter',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;--mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
    :root{--canvas:#1a1915;--surface:#21201a;--border:#38372f;--text:#f2f1ed;--muted:#a1a19f;--faint:#84847e;--ember:#ff6a24}
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  body{background:var(--canvas);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--sans);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  nav{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .navin{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text)}
  .brand svg{width:22px;height:22px}
  .brand span{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.1em}
  nav a.back{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
  nav a.back:hover{color:var(--text)}
  main{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px 24px 80px}
  h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,40px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.15}
  h2{font-size:19px;font-weight:500;margin:38px 0 10px;letter-spacing:-.005em}
  p,li{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;font-size:15px}
  ul,ol{padding-left:20px;margin:8px 0}
  a{color:var(--ember);text-decoration:none}
  a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .box{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;padding:20px 22px;margin-top:24px}
  .box p{color:var(--text)}
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;
    color:var(--faint);padding:22px 24px}
  footer a{color:var(--muted)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav><div class="navin">
  <a class="brand" href="/">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
      <rect x="5" y="8" width="30" height="27" rx="11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"/>
      <circle cx="15" cy="21" r="3" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="25" cy="21" r="3" fill="currentColor"/>
      <line x1="20" y1="8" x2="20" y2="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <circle cx="20" cy="3.5" r="2" fill="currentColor"/>
    </svg><span>NEVARRO</span>
  </a>
  <a class="back" href="/">← Home</a>
</div></nav>

<main>
  <h1>Support &amp; Escalation</h1>

  <div class="box">
    <p><strong>Primary support channel:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@nevarrotech.com">support@nevarrotech.com</a><br>
    First response within <strong>1 business day</strong> (Mon–Fri, IST). Engagement clients also receive a direct line at kickoff.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What support covers</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Questions about our services, engagements, and proposals</li>
    <li>Digital product purchases, downloads, and delivery issues</li>
    <li>Billing, invoices, receipts, and refund requests</li>
    <li>Bug reports for our tools (critical issues addressed within 2 business days)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Escalation path</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Level 1 — Support:</strong> email support@nevarrotech.com. Acknowledged within 1 business day; most issues resolved within 3 business days.</li>
    <li><strong>Level 2 — Founder review:</strong> if unresolved after 5 business days, reply with "ESCALATE" in the subject line. The founder personally reviews and responds within 2 business days.</li>
    <li><strong>Level 3 — Resolution:</strong> billing issues are resolved per our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>; we aim to close every escalation within 10 business days.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Billing disputes</h2>
  <p>Before raising a chargeback with your bank or payment provider, please contact us — genuine billing errors are refunded promptly, and direct resolution is always faster.</p>
</main>

<footer>© 2026 Nevarro Technologies · <a href="/terms">Terms</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
